[
    {
        "id": "tab-boollogic-demo",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "boolean-logic-plus example",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Demonstrates boolean-logic-plus configured for OR across 3 topics (A, B, C) - and a second instance with Invert ticked, giving NOR from the same inputs.\n\nFire the inject nodes in different combinations and watch all four outputs: OR result vs NOR result (should always be opposites), and the true/false breakdown for each (should always match each other, since Invert only affects the final result, not the raw topic breakdown). Note the breakdown output only fires when it actually changes - re-firing the same value twice in a row won't produce a second message on that port. Fire \"topic D (extra)\" to see the reset behaviour on both - no output at all until a fresh set of A/B/C arrives again."
    },
    {
        "id": "inject-a-true",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "tab-boollogic-demo",
        "name": "A: true",
        "props": [{ "p": "payload" }, { "p": "topic", "vt": "str" }],
        "repeat": "",
        "crontab": "",
        "once": false,
        "onceDelay": 0.1,
        "topic": "A",
        "payload": "true",
        "payloadType": "bool",
        "x": 190,
        "y": 60,
        "wires": [["boollogic-node1", "boollogic-node2"]]
    },
    {
        "id": "inject-a-false",
        "type": "inject",
        "z": "tab-boollogic-demo",
